{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7dcf8565acd72ed27d12ce5784c84322c6d71b8109163d3d7a73c13210494086", "ja": "深紅の騎士を倒すため、ゲーム内でライブを\n行いサーバーに過負荷をかけるという作戦が\n提案される。ライブは専売特許だ！　と盛り\n上がる琴葉、ジュリア、瑞希、翼、星梨花。\nそして、ステージの幕が上がった。", "zh": "为了打倒深红骑士，有人提议在游戏内进行演出，让服务器超负荷运转。琴叶、茱莉亚、瑞希、翼和星梨花兴奋地喊道：“现场演出可是我们的专利！”  \n于是，舞台的帷幕拉开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a849eeb48c2cb21e8629812e3cd9e42a049960ddc892c5988e5892b1d1516a4c", "ja": "（打倒・AIの騎士……。ゲームのルールの中では\n難しそうだが、何か方法はあるだろうか）", "zh": "（要打倒AI骑士……在游戏规则之内，似乎很难做到，但应该还是有办法的吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "2095cb408ca5dccc31849649b3cada06e4ba10710dae6389508ecfde6e186ef4", "ja": "あの深紅の騎士って、本当に強いんです。\n私の剣も、全然通用しなくて……。", "zh": "那个深红骑士，真的太强了。\n我的剑也完全不管用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "96be53cfc550e054883ba8817f358b6e0cc272ef461cf08dcd5ad74f829c6f0b", "ja": "わたし達の銃もダメでした。\n盾を構えられていると、弾が当たらないみたいです。", "zh": "我们的枪也不行。\n只要架起盾牌，子弹好像就打不中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "4e31bcf5b6db133bf35492ce0869924b633f03f5bb84901ac29ee1e76b50fa41", "ja": "んー……そしたら、隙を狙うしかないよな。\n後ろから不意打ちするとか？", "zh": "嗯——……这样的话，就只能找破绽了啊。\n从背后偷袭怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "95d83b3b656c73a2619acd63335d9a9a9a2d6809d7d8a9c30490c118f388226d", "ja": "まず隙を作る必要がありそうです。私の体がアバターで\nさえなければ、手品で気を引けたのですが……しゅん。", "zh": "看来首先得制造出破绽才行。如果我的身体不是虚拟形象，就能用魔术吸引注意力了……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27b7c859dfb409faac0723a1401ab313da998911ee983d7eb5ede3940aced437", "ja": "手品は見てくれないんじゃないかな～。わたしの\n胸も大きいのに、全然興味なさそうだったし～。", "zh": "他应该不会看魔术吧～明明我的胸部也很丰满，却好像完全没兴趣呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "1307e2d8ce62bfe0bf4e4af37cae5367a2028f57c67eddd16e1c6a8bb8155d5b", "ja": "「じゃあ、みんなでライブするとか？　歌はイヤでも\n聞こえるから、気になって隙ができるかも！」", "zh": "「那大家一起开演唱会怎么样？就算不想听也能听见歌声，说不定就会在意从而露出破绽呢！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1416ac83de762389b2c3087d58a989772af55b24af6538d67341186e7ad2c3b6", "ja": "「うーん、AIだからなぁ。そういう感情とかは、\n何年も人間と接したりしない限り無さそうだけど……」", "zh": "「唔——毕竟是AI啊。要是没有接触人类好几年，应该不会有那种感情吧……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "fa44f931085259f3e723618bab5d28953c723598c2bef7f863d4b7ecbbe1db3c", "ja": "はっ……！　{$P$}、盲点でした。\nライブ、いいかもしれません。", "zh": "哈……！{$P$}，我竟然忽略了这一点。演唱会，说不定不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2b8b8f7a34b54627d2c5a8d1d0ed58043b9ab0f336a0aa34dc4cdc59389927a3", "ja": "「えっ？　まさか、AIには感情が！？」", "zh": "「诶？难、难道说，AI其实是有感情的！？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "2a1dc06936cd560648ddf62026741740ca9396db9b88dada931f10397e824baa", "ja": "いえ、そうではなく。ここがもし、\nベータテスト中の新しいゲームだとしたら……。", "zh": "不，不是那样。如果这里是正在进行Beta测试的新游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "37c334968bd330c96cf3a48992212cbd8278cde57796aae1d34bb35bd014293f", "ja": "ライブにたくさんのプレイヤーを集めることで、\nわずかでも、処理が重くなるかもしれません。", "zh": "如果在演出中聚集大量玩家，哪怕只有一点点，也可能会让处理变得卡顿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "59202f379d2d77111aeedac0972947dea3592341c71d85ea6e221526fa9e70a9", "ja": "……！　ラグって……隙ができるかも……！", "zh": "……！　卡顿的话……说不定就能制造出破绽……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4703f46343e9eae40d85855bbbefbda8b310773d9a891b976046acd9399aa685", "ja": "「なるほど……処理負荷ってやつか……！」", "zh": "“原来如此……这就是处理负载啊……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "0aa6fcf0c20767e1fe6b2e59f61bbb798f171fde447f9bc1359c4fc42170da17", "ja": "あ！　それにライブをしたら、管理の人も、\nわたし達に気がついてくれるかもしれません！", "zh": "啊！而且要是举办了演唱会，管理员先生\n说不定也会注意到我们呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "72ab4706a06b94a06f689ffda03953bebd567e14b1f0af648aaba29675c1b90e", "ja": "へへっ、いいことづくめじゃないか。\nこいつは、派手にやるしかないな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，这不是好事成双嘛。看来只能大干一场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "141e1473ca5d3a392cd121fbd188825e9ef4fce3faba8f51269abf021134ddcc", "ja": "うん……いいと思う！　ライブをするなら、\nレッスンできなかった分も取り返せそうだし！", "zh": "嗯……我觉得不错！既然要办演唱会，也正好能把没能练习的部分补回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "17b8df8d612b7ad39b075f230fd4bc348120a20376fcca455978ce9218f5a439", "ja": "じゃあ、さいっこーのライブにしなくちゃ！\nわたし、思いっきり歌っちゃいまーす♪", "zh": "那就一定要办一场最棒最棒的演唱会！我会尽情唱歌啦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "2fa5ea5ae1b42ac622e762dbdbb272d4cce9097d3a2cd1954e53b9c4ac3a73d1", "ja": "「宣伝はどうしようかしら。先にAIにバレても……\nあ、日時や場所は伏せたままの告知なら……？」", "zh": "“宣传该怎么办呢。要是先被AI察觉到了也……\n啊，要是发公告时把时间和地点瞒下来呢……？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "b8e0c76693bff5e5c3fd5885ea1c189647455b16757c391d9afe927440cb8afd", "ja": "「シークレットライブだね☆　ライブするって\n情報だけ広げるといいんじゃない？」", "zh": "“秘密演唱会呢☆ 只要把要举办演唱会的消息传播出去，不就好了吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d9ce87f8ba5c90dc237282bec9cce2c4bde4d356eb14506477a4cf4a1cec40e2", "ja": "「それだ！　よし、そういう事なら……」", "zh": "「就是这个！好，既然这样的话……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_1021", "source_sha256": "fdc2c95f4a3e2966d6f22c408b7bc0e064c934a8087678df4f9607c093fe3315", "ja": "任せてくれ！", "zh": "包在我身上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1912af562a0b2462057be24059b9332be796b0562818c0321e9f34a91fe3e3cc", "ja": "「ライブの準備なら任せてくれ！　こっちは本職だ。\nみんなに最高のステージを用意してみせる！」", "zh": "「演唱会的准备就包在我身上吧！这可是我的本行。\n我一定会为大家准备好最棒的舞台！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2001_050jul", "source_sha256": "f10c28a8cc4a886c3414cb63beaa6f0efa9b7a3ef70055d2e8f9e3d899162dfe", "ja": "ははっ、なんか、目的がズレてないか？\nま、らしくっていいけどさ♪", "zh": "哈哈，总觉得目标是不是偏了？\n不过，这样也很像你，不错嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2002_017kth", "source_sha256": "d7b32b8a46891947c53b76cbdefee02941183482dbdba37446800a132a0a84af", "ja": "ふふっ、どんな世界にいても、やっぱり私達は……。", "zh": "呵呵，无论身处怎样的世界，我们果然还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2003_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b7a0f82515c155f94b1019ada0389afdc6d2272954cc2ad3fcd295fec2c0cd1", "ja": "はい。私達は、アイドルです。\n……いえい。", "zh": "是的。我们是偶像。\n……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2005_p", "source_sha256": "25831493f829dfcbb65ba2cb8b47ca08609eaba234f5798dfd23dcff80dea800", "ja": "（その後、突貫作業でライブの準備が進められた。\nステージ演出、歌やダンスのレッスン……）", "zh": "（之后，大家加班加点地准备起了演唱会。舞台演出、歌曲和舞蹈的训练……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2006_p", "source_sha256": "bb9d4dbd4c41809e32b18c25d040d9843f8460cd0e0a30592ae4918fd89c2313", "ja": "（そして、リトルミズキでの宣伝活動。みんなの\nモチベーションは最高潮のまま、開演時間を迎えた）", "zh": "（然后是Little Mizuki的宣传活动。在大家的干劲依旧高涨的情况下，迎来了开演时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2007_044miz", "source_sha256": "50335a219600c424668926923814013f87fb5e414915d5c45d7e153660ca3495", "ja": "おお……みなさん、客席を見てください。\n凄い人の数です……満員御礼。", "zh": "哦……大家，请看观众席。\n人真多啊……座无虚席。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2008_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "e070192e4f4e7de550bab277f4ba4eed0e7f32ac73090da9ac4a8dfd71aee4bd", "ja": "ザワザワ、ガヤガヤ……！", "zh": "窃窃私语，喧喧嚷嚷……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2009_022ser", "source_sha256": "96c633eacd67e91e67e2015e73e00cd04a333a177adbd45da4289b9e7d16bb74", "ja": "わぁ……これってみなさん、アバターなんですよね？\nわたし達も……なんだか、不思議です！", "zh": "哇……大家现在的样子，其实都是虚拟形象对吧？\n我们也是……总觉得，好不可思议啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2010_050jul", "source_sha256": "f931499076c64f8e538c7e5cbf1e475016e8f389a4a6bf9e4e15d524fdc6b4ac", "ja": "いつもと同じさ。ステージが終わったら、\n{$P$}のところに帰る。そうだろ？", "zh": "和平时一样啦。舞台演出结束后，\n就回到{$P$}身边。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2011_p", "source_sha256": "45b537019d8bf9250a39fee0dc97573d4925e8d05cd99217d6f11e993df7ec73", "ja": "「ああ、そうだな……よし、みんな！\nいつもどおり、最高のライブを見せてくれ！」", "zh": "“啊，说得对……好，大家！\n一如往常，拿出最棒的演出给我看吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_06_2012_044miz", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
